This product includes the compiled seal kernel evaluator (public/wasm/seal.js,
public/wasm/seal.wasm) — a black-box WebAssembly build of the verified seal
mediation kernel (sha256
0b5e792500592b56847f70b1e27e47aecdc65023c7c59fd79695102c465f26ec). The kernel's
decision logic is the subject of public Lean 4 proofs. The compiled artifact is
redistributed here as the public "black-box evaluator"; its source build pipeline
is not included in this repository.

